    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please, close your eyes and imagine an apple.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you see it? Can you feel it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you can, you should take a bite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/5a210566dd7d7539293bb66887001583.poster.avif?t=1745413552\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/5a210566dd7d7539293bb66887001583.webp?t=1745413552\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Julio wakes up in the Labyrinth Beyond Time and Space having forgotten his past. With the help of his boyfriend, Amador, they must embark on a quest to recover his memories stolen by the witch Mnemosyne and his nine muses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will they recover his memories and escape the labyrinth? </i><i><br>In the process, will they fall in love all over again? </i><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/9e2c8f8401711f9d35a5c644760a3f9c.poster.avif?t=1745413552\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/9e2c8f8401711f9d35a5c644760a3f9c.webm?t=1745413552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/9e2c8f8401711f9d35a5c644760a3f9c.mp4?t=1745413552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim your way to victory, use the power of the elements to your advantage and discover the meaning of love, oranges and what tomorrow holds in this fun RPG!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/8171a6ccf15e7467d92e28f03fe4a0ba.poster.avif?t=1745413552\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/8171a6ccf15e7467d92e28f03fe4a0ba.webp?t=1745413552\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=100 /></picture></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A unique take on progression, where in each area you must figure out a strategy from random equipment you scavenge. It's like a combo between a rogue-like and a randomizer.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A fun (and maybe heartfelt) story with a few twists and turns!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Many mementos to customize your trek through the labyrinth: Arts to use in battle, attack modifiers and strange passive effects!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>9+ different areas, bosses and many secrets ready for you!</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you're reading this far in, I'm sure you'll find much more to enjoy!</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/b0885c833f7b5e596f7e6f7e3282e9f9.avif?t=1745413552\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please, close your eyes and imagine an apple.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you see it? Can you feel it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you can, you should take a bite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/5a210566dd7d7539293bb66887001583.poster.avif?t=1745413552\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/5a210566dd7d7539293bb66887001583.webp?t=1745413552\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Julio wakes up in the Labyrinth Beyond Time and Space having forgotten his past. With the help of his boyfriend, Amador, they must embark on a quest to recover his memories stolen by the witch Mnemosyne and his nine muses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will they recover his memories and escape the labyrinth? </i><i><br>In the process, will they fall in love all over again? </i><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/9e2c8f8401711f9d35a5c644760a3f9c.poster.avif?t=1745413552\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/9e2c8f8401711f9d35a5c644760a3f9c.webm?t=1745413552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/9e2c8f8401711f9d35a5c644760a3f9c.mp4?t=1745413552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim your way to victory, use the power of the elements to your advantage and discover the meaning of love, oranges and what tomorrow holds in this fun RPG!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/8171a6ccf15e7467d92e28f03fe4a0ba.poster.avif?t=1745413552\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/8171a6ccf15e7467d92e28f03fe4a0ba.webp?t=1745413552\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=100 /></picture></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A unique take on progression, where in each area you must figure out a strategy from random equipment you scavenge. It's like a combo between a rogue-like and a randomizer.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A fun (and maybe heartfelt) story with a few twists and turns!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Many mementos to customize your trek through the labyrinth: Arts to use in battle, attack modifiers and strange passive effects!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>9+ different areas, bosses and many secrets ready for you!</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you're reading this far in, I'm sure you'll find much more to enjoy!</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341430/extras/b0885c833f7b5e596f7e6f7e3282e9f9.avif?t=1745413552\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>",
